{"data": [{"author_id": "1128198342859563008", "created_at": "2026-10-28T15:18:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115463235541573857"], "id": "2115463235541573857", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 243, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📑 高盛 A 股收盘\n\n📊 上证指数 +0.91%｜科创 50 +2.45%\n📊 上证 50 +0.23%｜创业板指 +3.40%\n📊 沪深 300 +0.85%｜中证 500 +1.99%\n💴 全天总成交额 1.64 万亿元，较前一日上涨 11.49%\n📈 A 股跟随亚太市场强势走势迎来修复反弹。\n📌 上证指数下午盘中震荡加大，但是在 AI", "url": "https://x.com/ming69621583/status/2115463235541573857"}, {"author_id": "1321270432385896448", "created_at": "2026-10-27T03:10:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114917649939329468"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/uQGYyjSazL", "end": 175, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Dragonhau66/status/2114917649939329468/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114917645472485377", "start": 152, "url": "https://t.co/uQGYyjSazL"}]}, "id": "2114917649939329468", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1826, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A股今天（10月27日）的盘面，一句话就能说透：\n高开是诱饵，缩量是真相，个股在流血，底部还看不到希望？\n\n开盘倒是给了希望：\n三大指数集体高开，沪指微涨，创业板指涨0.89%，超2700只个股飘红，通信设备、半导体领涨。\n\n盘中希望破灭：\n没撑多久，三大指数集体翻绿。下跌个股迅速扩大到超2900只。 https://t.co/uQGYyjSazL", "url": "https://x.com/Dragonhau66/status/2114917649939329468"}, {"author_id": "1996551578187436033", "created_at": "2026-10-27T06:39:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114970305311694865"], "id": "2114970305311694865", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1297, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📊 下午观点 | 双创午后直线杀跌，创指-1.6%、4500家下跌，银行零售硬扛旗（沪指14:37报3674.74 -0.62%）\n\n▪️", "url": "https://x.com/YoooJJ8cm/status/2114970305311694865"}, {"author_id": "2108191189019381760", "created_at": "2026-10-27T08:46:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115002165194567970"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 27, "start": 23, "tag": "交易台"}]}, "id": "2115002165194567970", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 543, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "GS CHINA MIDDAY 高盛中国午评\n#交易台 \n\n上证综指下跌 0.13%,科创 50 下跌 1.50%。\n上证 50 下跌 0.33%,创业板指下跌 0.45%。\n沪深 300 下跌 0.13%,中证 500 下跌 0.85%。\n中国 A 股总成交额为 0.88 万亿人民币。\n中国股市走势分化,交易活动清淡。上午盘总成交额仅为 0.87", "url": "https://x.com/2030FY_X/status/2115002165194567970"}, {"author_id": "2108191189019381760", "created_at": "2026-10-27T11:54:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115049576172589453"], "id": "2115049576172589453", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 478, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "GS CHINA WRAP GS 中国市场综述\n\n上证综指下跌 1.33%,科创 50 下跌 4.81%。\n上证 50 下跌 0.80%,创业板指下跌 3.41%。\n沪深 300 下跌 1.32%,中证 500 下跌 3.00%。\n全天成交额 1.47 万亿元人民币,较前一日下降 9.25%。\n今日港股、A 股表现弱于亚太区域其他市场,全天大部分时间走势平淡,尾盘最后 30", "url": "https://x.com/2030FY_X/status/2115049576172589453"}, {"author_id": "1128198342859563008", "created_at": "2026-10-27T04:52:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114943267402076308"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 28, "start": 24, "tag": "交易台"}]}, "id": "2114943267402076308", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 259, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📌GS CHINA MIDDAY 高盛中国午评\n#交易台 \n\n📈上证综指下跌 0.13%，科创 50 下跌 1.50%。\n📉上证 50 下跌 0.33%，创业板指下跌 0.45%。\n📊沪深 300 下跌 0.13%，中证 500 下跌 0.85%。\n💰中国 A 股总成交额为 0.88 万亿人民币。\n🌤️中国股市走势分化，交易活动清淡。上午盘总成交额仅为 0.87", "url": "https://x.com/ming69621583/status/2114943267402076308"}, {"author_id": "1128198342859563008", "created_at": "2026-10-27T12:11:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115053702306480354"], "id": "2115053702306480354", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 194, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📌GS CHINA WRAP GS 中国市场综述\n\n📉上证综指下跌 1.33%，科创 50 下跌 4.81%。\n📉上证 50 下跌 0.80%，创业板指下跌 3.41%。\n📉沪深 300 下跌 1.32%，中证 500 下跌 3.00%。\n💰全天成交额 1.47 万亿元人民币，较前一日下降 9.25%。\n🌤️今日港股、A", "url": "https://x.com/ming69621583/status/2115053702306480354"}, {"author_id": "2105582591122583552", "created_at": "2026-10-27T12:38:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115060600623804530"], "id": "2115060600623804530", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 89, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📌GS CHINA WRAP GS 中国市场综述#交易台   \n\n📉上证综指下跌 1.33%，科创 50 下跌 4.81%。\n📉上证 50 下跌 0.80%，创业板指下跌 3.41%。\n📉沪深 300 下跌 1.32%，中证 500 下跌 3.00%。\n💰全天成交额 1.47 万亿元人民币，较前一日下降 9.25%。\n🌤️今日港股、A", "url": "https://x.com/HDchengzhu/status/2115060600623804530"}, {"author_id": "2108191189019381760", "created_at": "2026-10-27T01:34:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114893510042357886"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 15, "start": 11, "tag": "交易台"}]}, "id": "2114893510042357886", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 313, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📑GS 中国收盘速览\n#交易台 \n\n📊 上证综指上涨 0.19%,科创 50 下跌 2.23%。\n📊 上证 50 上涨 0.41%,创业板指下跌 1.71%。\n📊 沪深 300 下跌 0.04%,中证 500 下跌 1.49%。\n💴 全天成交总额 1.62 万亿元,较前一日下降 17.73%。\n📌 A 股各大指数收盘表现分化。上证综指在临近早盘收盘阶段拉升,最终收涨 19", "url": "https://x.com/2030FY_X/status/2114893510042357886"}, {"author_id": "1634530036152963072", "created_at": "2026-10-28T12:23:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115419098066845739", "2115419612838051994"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/qLvMRfwSgq", "end": 192, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/maobidao/status/2115419098066845739/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115418739592286208", "start": 169, "url": "https://t.co/qLvMRfwSgq"}]}, "id": "2115419098066845739", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "明天要开盘了，把重要的事情简单捋一下。\n今天上证收在 3681.47，涨 0.91%，早盘低开 0.78%，全天振幅只有 0.88%，收盘站在全天 91% 的位置上，这个形态叫一路往上顶，低开那点口子当天就补掉还多给了一截。\n真正有故事的在下面那张脸。深成指涨 2.02%，创业板指涨 3.40%，科创50 涨 2.45%，中证1000 https://t.co/qLvMRfwSgq", "url": "https://x.com/maobidao/status/2115419098066845739"}, {"author_id": "1996551578187436033", "created_at": "2026-10-28T02:48:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115274487931469996"], "id": "2115274487931469996", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 528, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "开盘高开1%直接冲顶，然后一路往下磨——沪指从3677砸回3654，涨幅只剩+0.16%，机器人+传媒在里面硬撑\n\n▪️", "url": "https://x.com/YoooJJ8cm/status/2115274487931469996"}, {"author_id": "895032812457181184", "created_at": "2026-10-27T14:46:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115092816082976991"], "id": "2115092816082976991", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 52, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "突发新闻：A股尾盘跳水！创业板盘中涨超1%到收盘反跌3.41%，全市场超4900只个股下跌", "url": "https://x.com/francia781119/status/2115092816082976991"}, {"author_id": "1219037676474527745", "created_at": "2026-10-28T09:04:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115368981150433514"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 154, "start": 151, "tag": "A股"}, {"end": 159, "start": 155, "tag": "半导体"}]}, "id": "2115368981150433514", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 86, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "中韩半导体ETF一天成交202亿，居全市场第一\n\n全市场成交额第一的ETF，是投资韩国芯片的。\n\n不是沪深300，不是创业板，是中韩半导体，当天涨8.05%。\n\n同一天，酒ETF跌1.93%，券商ETF跌1.55%。\n\n资金不是在加仓A股，是在从防守里搬家到存储。\n\n你觉得这是新主线，还是一日游？\n\n#A股 #半导体", "url": "https://x.com/WindRider_Stock/status/2115368981150433514"}, {"author_id": "2060298489305890816", "created_at": "2026-10-27T03:39:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114924806953173482"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/CHHdPZWfkT", "end": 177, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/my2026vpn/status/2114924806953173482/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114924794395406336", "start": 154, "url": "https://t.co/CHHdPZWfkT"}]}, "id": "2114924806953173482", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 19, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "午评：指数在装死，你的账户在真死\n\n上午收盘，沪指跌0.13%，深成指跌0.33%，创业板跌0.45%。光看这几个数，好像还挺体面——“小幅调整”嘛，岁月静好。但低头看一眼自己的持仓，超过3700只个股在跌。翻译成人话就是：指数在午休，你的账户在ICU里加班。\n\n第一，银行又在“救驾”了，可惜救的不是你。 https://t.co/CHHdPZWfkT", "url": "https://x.com/my2026vpn/status/2114924806953173482"}, {"author_id": "1088377627", "created_at": "2026-10-27T01:01:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114885237264327008"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 3, "start": 0, "tag": "A股"}, {"end": 7, "start": 4, "tag": "早评"}]}, "id": "2114885237264327008", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 654, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "#A股 #早评 \n\n昨天沪指微涨0.19%，创业板跌1.71%，科创板跌2.23%，两市成交额缩至1.61万亿，较前一日减少3500亿！周五放量大反攻，周一却迅速缩量，说明增量资金没有持续进场，市场信心依然脆弱。\n\n现在判断行情，核心不是看指数红不红，而是看成交量能不能持续回升！", "url": "https://x.com/Sarah4u2013/status/2114885237264327008"}, {"author_id": "304165652", "created_at": "2026-10-28T07:41:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115348174097498331"], "id": "2115348174097498331", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 186, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "股价拖累，三季度基金持有券商股市值缩水133亿，被动资金是加仓主力\n\n财联社10月28日讯（记者 陈俊兰）随着公募基金三季报披露收官，基金对券商股的配置变化浮出水面。", "url": "https://x.com/najoygo/status/2115348174097498331"}, {"author_id": "1006082493659746304", "created_at": "2026-10-28T08:43:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115363931871121867"], "id": "2115363931871121867", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 27, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "创业板午盘涨 3%，人形机器人 30 只股涨停——导火索是上海昨天印发的智能制造行动方案。\n\n沪指午盘 +0.72% 报 3674，深成指 +1.99%，半天成交 1.01 万亿。政策托底还在，机器人是今天最硬的题材。\n\n但先别喊反转：量没回 2", "url": "https://x.com/tuscan_moon/status/2115363931871121867"}, {"author_id": "1996551578187436033", "created_at": "2026-10-28T06:41:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115333207734550708"], "id": "2115333207734550708", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 519, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📊 午后跟踪 | 沪指+0.83%摸到3684.49就是差那半口气，创指冲高3.90%又全吐回来了\n\n▪️ 午后指数变动：上午高开冲高，下午原地磨\n沪指午间3674.44（+0.72%）→ 现在3678.70（+0.83%），两个多小时只挪了4个点。全天最高3684.49，是早上打出来的，离昨天箱体下沿3685就差0.51点，愣是没敢碰。", "url": "https://x.com/YoooJJ8cm/status/2115333207734550708"}, {"author_id": "720195544044273664", "created_at": "2026-10-28T07:10:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115340471321194774"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 3, "start": 0, "tag": "A股"}, {"end": 9, "start": 4, "tag": "收盘复盘"}, {"end": 14, "start": 11, "tag": "收评"}]}, "id": "2115340471321194774", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 25, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "#A股 #收盘复盘  #收评 \n\n收盘点评：创业板反弹超 3%，放量反弹仍需二次确认\n\n今日 A 股震荡修复，成长赛道领涨。创业板指大涨超 3%，深成指、科创 50 涨幅均超 2%。两市全天成交 1.63 万亿，较前一日放量 1675 亿，全市场超 4100 只个股收涨，普涨格局下市场赚钱效应明显回暖。", "url": "https://x.com/moo840805/status/2115340471321194774"}, {"author_id": "1380720896038424579", "created_at": "2026-10-28T11:40:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115408235427426647"], "id": "2115408235427426647", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 313, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "10月28日的A股复盘：\n\n资金流向：大资金净流入211亿，超大资金流入303亿，散户流出202亿，北向资金放量至250亿、净流入400亿，连续4天爆量。\n\n买入方向：融资融券（杠杆加仓大市值）、半导体芯片、5G/6G偏C端、机器人、数据中心和算力。", "url": "https://x.com/suyu2018block/status/2115408235427426647"}, {"author_id": "1810525451485614080", "created_at": "2026-10-28T06:37:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115332094616342742"], "id": "2115332094616342742", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "今天A股小微盘股突然暴力反弹，中证2000半天涨了2.76%，中证1000涨了2.6%，而上证50几乎趴着没动。很多人以为是中小盘基本面反转了，其实说白了就是跌透了之后的超跌修复。", "url": "https://x.com/haige2330/status/2115332094616342742"}, {"author_id": "1596664795532390401", "created_at": "2026-10-28T14:41:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115453815134806493"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/lKAQzJVwlA", "end": 150, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/AkZfl/status/2115453815134806493/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115453806482001920", "start": 127, "url": "https://t.co/lKAQzJVwlA"}]}, "id": "2115453815134806493", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 202, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "中国的AI泡沫，已经破了。你还在盯着英伟达的时候，它就破了。\n\n科创50，A股AI和芯片的门面，6月30日收盘2208点，昨天最低收到1252点，不到4个月跌了四成多，蒸发大约4800亿美元。沪深300从6月高点跌了约20%，上证昨天收在14个月新低。 https://t.co/lKAQzJVwlA", "url": "https://x.com/AkZfl/status/2115453815134806493"}, {"author_id": "2060298489305890816", "created_at": "2026-10-28T04:48:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115304634638291293"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/mMpFH0rIgg", "end": 130, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/my2026vpn/status/2115304634638291293/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115304620121870336", "start": 107, "url": "https://t.co/mMpFH0rIgg"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/mMpFH0rIgg", "end": 130, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/my2026vpn/status/2115304634638291293/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115304620184727552", "start": 107, "url": "https://t.co/mMpFH0rIgg"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/mMpFH0rIgg", "end": 130, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/my2026vpn/status/2115304634638291293/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115304620126089217", "start": 107, "url": "https://t.co/mMpFH0rIgg"}]}, "id": "2115304634638291293", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "今天午盘这波反弹，更接近一次“超跌修复+情绪催化”的脉冲，而非趋势性反转的确立。它有真实的催化剂，但资金面和技术面尚未给出持续性的确认信号。\n\n📈 反弹的驱动：有“真东西”，但偏外部和情绪\n\n今天领涨的核心逻辑是 https://t.co/mMpFH0rIgg", "url": "https://x.com/my2026vpn/status/2115304634638291293"}, {"author_id": "1680092936544092160", "created_at": "2026-10-28T08:07:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115354631643816139"], "id": "2115354631643816139", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 203, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "卧槽！！！A股今天终于扬眉吐气了一把！\n\n上证涨0.91%！\n深证涨2.02%！\n创业板更猛，暴涨3.40%！\n\n4156只股票上涨，成交额突破1.64万亿，大盘资金净流入236.92亿！\n\n昨天还绿得怀疑人生，今天直接红红火火！\n\n兄弟们，今天终于吃肉吃撑了吧？", "url": "https://x.com/DesertCamelX/status/2115354631643816139"}, {"article": {"title": "10月28日A股复盘，超4100只股票上涨，A股放量反弹，科技主线回来了吗？"}, "author_id": "989384002439077893", "created_at": "2026-10-28T11:39:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115408032519889399"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/i/article/2115…", "end": 53, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2115404910376488961", "start": 30, "status": 404, "unwound_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2115404910376488961", "url": "https://t.co/9MfLHSLE4z"}]}, "id": "2115408032519889399", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 95, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "本文仅为市场观察，不构成投资建议。市场有风险，投资需谨慎。 https://t.co/9MfLHSLE4z", "url": "https://x.com/Nemoblueblue/status/2115408032519889399"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "1128198342859563008", "name": "小明", "username": "ming69621583"}, {"id": "1321270432385896448", "name": "小龙先生", "username": "Dragonhau66"}, {"id": "1996551578187436033", "name": "人类股市观察家", "username": "YoooJJ8cm"}, {"id": "2108191189019381760", "name": "2030FY", "username": "2030FY_X"}, {"id": "2105582591122583552", "name": "混沌城主", "username": "HDchengzhu"}, {"id": "1634530036152963072", "name": "猫笔刀", "username": "maobidao"}, {"id": "895032812457181184", "name": "美股风向标/Market Impulse", "username": "francia781119"}, {"id": "12190376764745277